Original commit body from fbe590b:

Ripgrep's -f flag expects one pattern per line, not a single combined
alternation. With 29,036 symbols, the giant \b(a|b|c|...)\b pattern
caused ripgrep's regex engine to error (exit code 2).

Now we write each \bname\b pattern on its own line and let ripgrep
handle the OR'ing internally.
